<title>GERMANY: Boehringer Ingelheim H1 sales up 6.8 pct at 3.4.</title>
<headline>Boehringer Ingelheim H1 sales up 6.8 pct at 3.4.</headline>
<dateline>INGELHEIM, Germany 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30 (in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group sales				  3,430   up 6.8 pct</p>
<p>    Prescription Drugs sales		 2,865   up 6 pct</p>
<p>    Animal health sales			176     up 53 pct</p>
<p>    Chemicals				    215     down 8 pct</p>
<p>    Group research and development	 578     vs 501</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the privately owned German pharmaceuticals and drugs group is Boehringer Ingelheim. For the year as a whole the group forecasts sales of around seven billion marks after 6.4 last year.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
